              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lalezozitho zomzimba esicabanga ukuthi azihlonitshwa kancane, phezu kwazo sizinika udumo olukhulu kakhulu; nezitho zethu ezingafanelekiyo zinobuhle obengeziwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
