              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uma kuhlupheka isitho sinye, kuhlupheka izitho zonke kanye naso; noma kuhlonishwe isitho sinye, athokoze amalungu onke kanye nalo.",
          "type": "text",
